{"page":481,"verses":[{"verse_key":"41:39","surah":41,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ أَنَّكَ تَرَى ٱلْأَرْضَ خَـٰشِعَةً فَإِذَآ أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْهَا ٱلْمَآءَ ٱهْتَزَّتْ وَرَبَتْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَحْيَاهَا لَمُحْىِ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰٓ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Another of His signs is this: you see the earth lying desolate, but when We send water down on to it, it stirs and grows. He who gives it life will certainly give life to the dead. He has power over everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"And among","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"His Signs","transliteration":"āyātihi","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"(is) that you","transliteration":"annaka","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَرَى","en_gloss":"see","transliteration":"tarā","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَـٰشِعَةًۭ","en_gloss":"barren","transliteration":"khāshiʿatan","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَإِذَآ","en_gloss":"but when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We send down","transliteration":"anzalnā","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","en_gloss":"upon it","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمَآءَ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"l-māa","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱهْتَزَّتْ","en_gloss":"it is stirred (to life)","transliteration":"ih'tazzat","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَرَبَتْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and grows","transliteration":"warabat","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَحْيَاهَا","en_gloss":"gives it life","transliteration":"aḥyāhā","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَمُحْىِ","en_gloss":"(is) surely the Giver of life","transliteration":"lamuḥ'yī","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"(to) the dead","transliteration":"l-mawtā","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":20,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":21,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":22,"ar":"قَدِيرٌ","en_gloss":"All-Powerful","transliteration":"qadīrun","verse_key":"41:39"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"41:39"}]},{"verse_key":"41:40","surah":41,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يُلْحِدُونَ فِىٓ ءَايَـٰتِنَا لَا يَخْفَوْنَ عَلَيْنَآ ۗ أَفَمَن يُلْقَىٰ فِى ٱلنَّارِ خَيْرٌ أَم مَّن يَأْتِىٓ ءَامِنًا يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ ٱعْمَلُوا۟ مَا شِئْتُمْ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who distort the meaning of Our message are not hidden from Us. Is he who is hurled into the Fire better, or he who comes through safely on the Day of Resurrection? Do whatever you want, God certainly sees everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"41:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"41:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُلْحِدُونَ","en_gloss":"distort","transliteration":"yul'ḥidūna","verse_key":"41:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"[in]","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"41:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"āyātinā","verse_key":"41:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(are) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"41:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَخْفَوْنَ","en_gloss":"hidden","transliteration":"yakhfawna","verse_key":"41:40"},{"pos":8